'''Magistrate Henry Maleb''' is a [[human]] quest giver located in the [[Southshore Town Hall]] in the [[Hillsbrad Foothills]]. He is the new magistrate of Southshore, recently assigned after the assassination of the previous magistrate.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|33|Syndicate Assassins}}</ref>

